* Post-quantum cryptography in 2026
** Quantum threat
*** Shor breaks RSA, ECC, pairings
*** Grover halves symmetric security
*** RSA-2048 under 1M noisy qubits (2025)
*** ECDLP-256 under 500k physical qubits (2026)
*** Harvest now, decrypt later
** NIST standards
*** FIPS 203 ML-KEM (KEM)
*** FIPS 204 ML-DSA (lattice signature)
*** FIPS 205 SLH-DSA (hash-based)
*** FIPS 206 FN-DSA / Falcon (draft)
*** HQC backup KEM (planned FIPS 207)
*** SP 800-208 LMS / XMSS
** Hybrid TLS
*** X25519MLKEM768
*** RFC 10024 (August 2026)
*** Authentication still classical
left side
